{"question": "How many MW of batteries operate in ERCOT today, and how many MW of stand-alone battery requests are active in Berkeley Lab's queue data?", "grid": "ercot", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "today": "2026-10-04", "retried": false, "first_violations": [], "request_ids": ["req_011Cfgq4169tudoDbivXrJQh", "req_011Cfgq4Ge3HwKLqyQwSxDDg", "req_011Cfgq4VXvs8F5yE19KpUkk", "req_011Cfgq4jtd9y76sv2MoyC8e", "req_011Cfgq4vqTEFqUCujHBCPMf", "req_011Cfgq5DfyRJm5h6hdwUPSX"], "status": "answered", "answer": "Operating batteries: 18,204.5 MW across 259 operating units in ERCOT (storage_capacity, derived from EIA-860M, August 2026 vintage, nameplate MW). That is the latest monthly snapshot, not a live figure for today.\n\nBerkeley Lab's queue data, and its stand-alone battery request count, are not in the warehouse. The warehouse also does not split stand-alone batteries from co-located ones. The nearest figure is ERCOT's own Generation Interconnection Status report, which is a different source from Berkeley Lab. In it, active positions with fuel 'Other - Battery Energy Storage' total 122,304.92 MW across 652 positions (ercot_interconnection_queue, snapshot of 2026-09-30). That figure may include co-located batteries, so it should not be read as Berkeley Lab's stand-alone number.", "citations": [{"table": "storage_capacity", "source_report": "erw:storage_capacity", "data_version": "local backend, data commit de240aa799cc; table last run 2026-09-29T23:58:50Z", "tier": "derived"}, {"table": "ercot_interconnection_queue", "source_report": "ercot:interconnection_queue", "data_version": "local backend, data commit de240aa799cc; table last run 2026-09-26T00:06:45Z", "tier": "source"}], "not_in_warehouse": false, "tool_calls": 8, "calls": [{"tool": "list_tables", "input": {"iso": "ERCOT"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 5818}, {"tool": "list_tables", "input": {"sector": "capacity"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 195}, {"tool": "describe_table", "input": {"table": "ercot_interconnection_queue"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 2699}, {"tool": "describe_table", "input": {"table": "storage_buildout_monthly"}, "is_error": true, "result_chars": 109}, {"tool": "query", "input": {"table": "storage_capacity", "aggregation": "sum", "where": {"status": "operating"}}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 782}, {"tool": "describe_table", "input": {"table": "storage_capacity"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 3116}, {"tool": "query", "input": {"table": "ercot_interconnection_queue", "aggregation": "sum", "where": {"status": "active", "fuel_technology": "Other - Battery Energy Storage"}}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 841}, {"tool": "query", "input": {"table": "ercot_interconnection_queue", "aggregation": "count", "where": {"status": "active", "fuel_technology": "Other - Battery Energy Storage"}}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 818}], "usage": {"input": 14, "output": 1802, "cache_write": 8613, "cache_read": 177139, "requests": 6}, "cost_usd": 0.0750083, "seconds": 21.2, "id": "e33", "kind": "join", "arm": "before", "score": {"refusal": true, "number": false, "text": true, "citation": true, "correct": false}, "expected": [18204.5, 120940.58], "expected_text": [], "expected_tables": ["storage_buildout_monthly", "lbnl_interconnection_queue", "storage_capacity"], "expected_refuse": false}
{"question": "What was the highest real-time price at the ERCOT hub average in 2021, and in which month did it happen?", "grid": "ercot", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "today": "2026-10-04", "retried": true, "first_violations": ["15"], "request_ids": ["req_011Cfgq5ZZJ8XX3uDqaxMzRT", "req_011Cfgq5jd2rn63iR8o6sEQL", "req_011Cfgq5qFcyyTWhumAyAc3x", "req_011Cfgq688P7ssXPyqhrjEF2", "req_011Cfgq6JavLQxMvtiFzSNPs", "req_011Cfgq6TrHotgAzbhNF7kgK", "req_011Cfgq6cnJReVVXrqhtXpQX", "req_011Cfgq6nLXQW9f5AVvVirB3", "req_011Cfgq74nz5UKGcdoRRBVhG"], "first_answer": "The highest real-time price at the ERCOT hub average (HB_HUBAVG) in 2021 was 9,051.55 USD/MWh, in February 2021 (ercot_peak_premium_monthly, variable all_max, month labelled in America/Chicago local time). This is the maximum 15-minute real-time interval that month, which was the Winter Storm Uri period. The next-highest monthly maxima were 2,001.0 USD/MWh in April and 1,952.86 USD/MWh in June (ercot_peak_premium_monthly). The annual table gives the same 9,051.55 USD/MWh for 2021 (ercot_peak_premium_annual). Both tables are derived by the ERW from ERCOT's 15-minute real-time prices.", "status": "answered", "answer": "The highest real-time price at the ERCOT hub average (HB_HUBAVG) in 2021 was 9,051.55 USD/MWh, in February 2021 (ercot_peak_premium_monthly, variable all_max, month labelled in America/Chicago local time). This is the maximum real-time interval price that month, which was the Winter Storm Uri period. The next-highest monthly maxima were 2,001.0 USD/MWh in April and 1,952.86 USD/MWh in June (ercot_peak_premium_monthly). The annual table gives the same 9,051.55 USD/MWh for 2021 (ercot_peak_premium_annual). Both tables are derived by the ERW from ERCOT's real-time prices.", "citations": [{"table": "ercot_peak_premium_monthly", "source_report": "erw:ercot_peak_premium", "data_version": "local backend, data commit de240aa799cc; table last run 2026-09-29T00:55:55Z", "tier": "derived"}, {"table": "ercot_peak_premium_annual", "source_report": "erw:ercot_peak_premium", "data_version": "local backend, data commit de240aa799cc; table last run 2026-09-29T00:55:55Z", "tier": "derived"}], "not_in_warehouse": false, "tool_calls": 8, "calls": [{"tool": "query", "input": {"table": "ercot_all_hub_prices_history", "aggregation": "max", "entity": "ercot:HB_HUBAVG", "where": {"market": "ercot_rtm", "year": "2021"}, "tz": "America/Chicago"}, "is_error": true, "result_chars": 113}, {"tool": "list_tables", "input": {"iso": "ERCOT"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 5818}, {"tool": "query", "input": {"table": "ercot_peak_premium_monthly", "aggregation": "max", "entity": "ercot:HB_HUBAVG", "variable": "all_max", "start": "2021-01-01", "end": "2022-01-01"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 1060}, {"tool": "query", "input": {"table": "ercot_peak_premium_annual", "aggregation": "max", "entity": "ercot:HB_HUBAVG", "variable": "all_max", "start": "2021-01-01", "end": "2022-01-01"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 1056}, {"tool": "query", "input": {"table": "ercot_peak_premium_monthly", "aggregation": "max", "entity": "ercot:HB_HUBAVG", "variable": "all_max", "start": "2021-01-01", "end": "2022-01-01", "group_by": "month"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 2261}, {"tool": "query", "input": {"table": "ercot_peak_premium_monthly", "aggregation": "max", "entity": "ercot:HB_HUBAVG", "variable": "all_max", "start": "2021-01-01", "end": "2022-01-01"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 1060}, {"tool": "query", "input": {"table": "ercot_peak_premium_monthly", "aggregation": "max", "entity": "ercot:HB_HUBAVG", "variable": "all_max", "start": "2021-01-01", "end": "2022-01-01"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 1060}, {"tool": "query", "input": {"table": "ercot_peak_premium_monthly", "aggregation": "max", "entity": "ercot:HB_HUBAVG", "variable": "all_max", "start": "2021-01-01", "end": "2022-01-01"}, "is_error": false, "result_chars": 1060}], "usage": {"input": 22, "output": 2390, "cache_write": 9